    "long_instructions": "# Hurricane Maria\r\n\r\nAnalyze sea-surface temperatures recorded during Hurricane Maria.\r\n\r\n1. Run the starter code and review the dataset information and statistics.\r\n2. Use `min()`, `max()`, and `sum()` to calculate statistics for `ANALYSED_SST`.\r\n3. Group the data by `DATETIME` and use `agg()` to calculate the total, average, minimum, and maximum temperatures for each date.\r\n4. Discuss the trends or anomalies you notice and form a hypothesis about what may have influenced them.\r\n\r\n:::: details [Need Help?]\r\n\r\nAsk AI Tutor for an example, documentation, or an explanation of the code or output. Use its guidance to complete the work yourself.\r\n\r\n::::",
